      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Luxury living in Dublin 16!\r\n\r\nWhat an opportunity this is to rent this superb semi-detached home in a secluded development, close to the M50, Dundrum Shopping Centre & Sandyford Business Parks.\r\n\r\nAVAILABLE FRIDAY 4TH DECEMBER 2026. \r\n\r\nOFFERED FULLY FURNISHED & INCLUDING WiFi Broadband\r\n\r\n11 Delbrook Manor is a stunning home being offered to the letting market for the first time. From the moment you walk into the front door, you are welcomed with a sense of entering a much-loved home.\r\n\r\nThere are many features to this home, with the main one being the full-width extension to the rear, which now offers an extra-large kitchen/dining/living space. With the added benefit of an attic conversion, this house offers spacious and flexible accommodation to suit all.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned within this much sought-after quiet residential development, overlooking a communal green and in a quiet cul-de-sac. The location really could not be any better, with a host of amenities close by in Dundrum Town Centre and village offering a variety of specialist shops, supermarkets, cafes, restaurants and many more entertainment options. Ballinteer Shopping Centre, Sandyford Business Park and Stillorgan village are also a short drive away. Excellent transport links abound within the area, including the nearby LUAS at Balally and several bus routes, M50 and N11 providing ease of access to the city centre.\r\n\r\nThis superbly presented home extends to approximately 155sq m and has a very appealing B1 BER rating. \r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming hallway, with understairs cloakroom and additional storage. The front living room has a bay window to the front overlooking the communal green, and a feature fireplace.\r\nTo the rear of the property is a large full-width extension, with a vaulted ceiling, allowing light to fill the downstairs accommodation.\r\nThe modern kitchen features integrated appliances and an island for convenient dining. There is a dining area and spacious living area with glass doors leading out to the enclosed rear garden.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the open landing leads into a master bedroom to the front with ample storage space. There is a further double bedroom to the rear. The family bathroom is extra-large in size and benefits from a sunken bath and separate shower cubicle.\r\nFrom the landing, there is a staircase leading to the attic /bedroom 3, enclosed with a door at the top of the stairs. This space has been recently redecorated and could be used for a variety of purposes.\r\n\r\nOutside, the front of the property is approached via a block-paved driveway providing off-street parking. There is side access to the rear.\r\nThe enclosed rear garden is private and is laid to lawn for ease of maintenance.\r\n\r\nThis is an incredible opportunity to rent a high-quality home in South Dublin."
      },
